@startuml

title Analog App - Static View

package "Analog App" {
    [ADC Read Handler] as readHandler
    note right of readHandler
        API: AnalogApp_ReadAdc(channel) -> raw_value
    end note
    [Channel Manager] as channelMgr
    [Sampling Controller] as samplingCtrl
}

[ADC Driver] as adcDriver
[Config Service] as configService

readHandler --> channelMgr : Select channel
channelMgr --> adcDriver : ADC operations
samplingCtrl --> adcDriver : Start conversion

note bottom of readHandler
    No DID/RID awareness.
    Receives typed channel number from CAC.
end note

@enduml